    bodyContent: `<h2>Two Different Tools Solving Two Different Problems</h2><p>I'll be honest — comparing AutoGrowth AI and ServiceTitan is a little like comparing a torque wrench to a full tool chest. One does a specific job really well. The other covers everything.</p><p>ServiceTitan is a full field service management platform. Scheduling, dispatch, pricebook, invoicing, customer history — it's all in there. It's built for running the operational side of a trades business. Over 7,500 contractors use it. That's not nothing.</p><p>AutoGrowth AI is built for one thing: stopping revenue from walking out the door. Missed calls, dead leads, zero follow-up, no reviews, reactivation of old customers. That's the lane it lives in.</p><p>Here's the thing — a lot of contractors use both. They're not really competitors. But if you're trying to figure out which one belongs in your budget right now, this breakdown will help.</p><h2>Feature Comparison</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>AutoGrowth AI</th><th>ServiceTitan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AI Receptionist / Missed Call Recovery</td><td>✅ Core feature</td><td>❌ Not included</td></tr><tr><td>Automated Follow-Up Sequences</td><td>✅ Core feature</td><td>⚠️ Via Marketing Pro add-on ($2,000+/mo)</td></tr><tr><td>Review Generation</td><td>✅ Included</td><td>⚠️ Limited, Marketing Pro add-on</td></tr><tr><td>Customer Reactivation Campaigns</td><td>✅ Included</td><td>⚠️ Via Marketing Pro add-on</td></tr><tr><td>Scheduling & Dispatch</td><td>❌ Not included</td><td>✅ Core feature</td></tr><tr><td>Invoicing & Payments</td><td>❌ Not included</td><td>✅ Core feature</td></tr><tr><td>Pricebook</td><td>❌ Not included</td><td>✅ Core feature</td></tr><tr><td>CRM</td><td>✅ Lead-focused CRM</td><td>✅ Full customer CRM</td></tr><tr><td>Atlas AI Assistant</td><td>❌</td><td>✅ Included</td></tr><tr><td>AI Voice Agents</td><td>✅ Core feature</td><td>✅ Available</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Pricing — Let's Talk Real Numbers</h2><h3>AutoGrowth AI</h3><ul><li><strong>$197–$499/month</strong> depending on plan</li><li>No setup fees worth mentioning</li><li>No per-tech pricing</li><li>Works for a 1-truck operation or a 20-truck company</li></ul><h3>ServiceTitan</h3><ul><li><strong>$245–$500 per tech per month</strong></li><li><strong>$5,000–$50,000 in setup and onboarding costs</strong></li><li>Marketing Pro add-on: <strong>$2,000+/month</strong> on top of base pricing</li><li>At 5 techs on a mid-tier plan, you're looking at $1,500–$2,500/month before any add-ons</li></ul><p>Look, ServiceTitan is expensive. They'll tell you it pays for itself and for a lot of contractors, it does. But that math only works at a certain company size. If you've got 8+ techs and you're doing $2M+ in revenue, the ROI is real. Below that? The price can crush you before you ever get the benefit.</p><h2>Pros and Cons</h2><h3>AutoGrowth AI</h3><ul><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Flat monthly pricing — no surprises based on headcount</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Live in days, not months</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Directly attacks revenue leaks most contractors ignore</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Works standalone or alongside ServiceTitan</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Not a full FSM — won't replace your scheduling or invoicing software</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Won't help with field operations, dispatch, or pricebook</li></ul><h3>ServiceTitan</h3><ul><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Best-in-class field operations management</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Massive ecosystem — integrations, reporting, everything</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Atlas AI is genuinely useful for larger operations</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Strong community and training resources</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Expensive, especially for smaller shops</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Long onboarding — we're talking months to get fully set up</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Follow-up and marketing automation cost extra, and that extra is significant</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Overkill if you just need to stop missing calls and losing leads</li></ul><h2>Best For</h2><h3>Choose ServiceTitan if...</h3><p>You're running $2M+ in revenue, have 8 or more techs, and need a full operations platform. If your current pain is dispatching, invoicing chaos, or pricebook consistency — ServiceTitan is the right call. It's the industry standard for a reason.</p><h3>Choose AutoGrowth AI if...</h3><p>You're losing jobs because nobody's answering the phone at 9pm. Your leads go cold because follow-up never happens. Your past customers haven't heard from you in 18 months. Your Google reviews are a ghost town. That's all revenue sitting on the table — and AutoGrowth AI is built to pick it up.</p><h3>Use Both if...</h3><p>Honestly? This is where a lot of growing contractors end up. ServiceTitan handles the job. AutoGrowth AI handles the revenue recovery around that job — the before and the after. They don't overlap. They stack.</p><h2>Bottom Line</h2><p>ServiceTitan is a serious platform for serious operations. If you're ready for it and can afford it, it's worth the investment. But it doesn't fix your missed call problem. It doesn't follow up with your dead leads. It doesn't wake up your old customer list.</p><p>That's exactly what AutoGrowth AI does. And it does it for less per month than most contractors spend on one unused software subscription they forgot to cancel.</p><p>Figure out which problem you need to solve first. Then pick the right tool for that problem.</p><h2>See How AutoGrowth AI Works For Your Business — Free Audit</h2><p>We'll look at where your business is leaking revenue right now — missed calls, dead leads, cold customers — and show you exactly what it's costing you. No pitch deck. No fluff. Just numbers.</p><p><a href="/audit"><strong>Get Your Free Revenue Audit →</strong></a></p>`,
