    metaDescription: "AutoGrowth AI vs Podium — honest comparison for HVAC contractors. See features, pricing ($399–$599/mo), and which platform actually fits your business.",
    blufBlock: `**If you run an HVAC business and you're choosing between AutoGrowth AI and Podium, AutoGrowth AI is the better fit — it's built for your industry, not adapted to it.** **Podium is a solid tool, but it's a generalist platform priced for businesses that don't need HVAC-specific workflows like seasonal reactivation, estimate follow-up, or membership renewal.**`,
    bodyContent: `<h2>The Short Version</h2><p>Podium is a legitimate platform. I'm not going to tell you it's garbage, because it's not. Lots of service businesses use it and get real value out of it. But here's the thing — "lots of service businesses" is exactly the problem. Podium is built for everyone from dentists to auto dealers to restaurants. AutoGrowth AI is built for HVAC contractors. That difference matters more than it sounds.</p><h2>Feature Comparison</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>AutoGrowth AI</th><th>Podium</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Review Generation</td><td>Yes — automated, HVAC-timed</td><td>Yes — strong, multi-platform</td></tr><tr><td>Webchat</td><td>Yes — HVAC-trained AI responses</td><td>Yes — general AI responses</td></tr><tr><td>Text Messaging</td><td>Yes — built into workflows</td><td>Yes — core feature</td></tr><tr><td>Estimate Follow-Up</td><td>Yes — automated sequences</td><td>No — not built in</td></tr><tr><td>Membership Renewal Reminders</td><td>Yes — automated</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Seasonal Reactivation Campaigns</td><td>Yes — HVAC seasonal triggers</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Financing Follow-Up</td><td>Yes — specific to HVAC sales</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Payments</td><td>Via integration</td><td>Yes — native feature</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing Campaigns</td><td>HVAC-focused automation</td><td>General campaigns</td></tr><tr><td>Industry-Specific Workflows</td><td>Yes — HVAC only</td><td>No — generic</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Look, Podium wins on payments and raw communication features. If you're a multi-industry business or you want a one-size-fits-all inbox, Podium checks those boxes. But every HVAC-specific row in that table? That's where AutoGrowth AI pulls ahead.</p><h2>Pricing Comparison</h2><p>Podium runs three tiers:</p><ul><li><strong>Core:</strong> ~$399/month</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> ~$599/month</li><li><strong>Signature:</strong> Custom pricing — call them to find out</li></ul><p>I'll be honest — $399 to $599 a month for a generalist platform is real money. And when you get to the Signature tier, they won't even tell you the price upfront. That's never a good sign for a small contractor trying to budget.</p><p>AutoGrowth AI is priced specifically for HVAC businesses. You're not paying for features built for dentists or car washes. You're paying for tools that actually match how your business runs — dispatch cycles, seasonal demand, membership programs, and financing conversations.</p><p>Get specific pricing for your situation at <a href="/audit">our free audit</a>. No sales theater, just real numbers.</p><h2>Pros and Cons</h2><h3>AutoGrowth AI</h3><ul><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Built specifically for HVAC — workflows match how the industry actually operates</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Automated estimate follow-up, membership renewals, and seasonal reactivation out of the box</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> HVAC-trained AI for webchat — customers get answers that make sense</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Financing follow-up sequences included — closes more jobs</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Not the right pick if you run a multi-trade or non-HVAC business</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Payments are via integration, not native</li></ul><h3>Podium</h3><ul><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Native payment processing — solid if collections are a pain point</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Strong review generation across multiple platforms</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Works across any industry — flexible if you're not purely HVAC</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> No HVAC-specific workflows — you'll build from scratch or go without</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> $399–$599/month for features that weren't designed with your business in mind</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Custom pricing at the top tier means unpredictable costs</li></ul><h2>Best For</h2><h3>Choose AutoGrowth AI if:</h3><ul><li>You run an HVAC company and want automation that fits your actual workflow</li><li>You're losing money on unbooked estimates or lapsed maintenance customers</li><li>You want seasonal reactivation and membership follow-up without building it yourself</li><li>You want AI that knows what a 16 SEER system is when a customer asks</li></ul><h3>Choose Podium if:</h3><ul><li>You run a multi-trade or non-HVAC business</li><li>Integrated payments are a top priority</li><li>You want a broad communication inbox and you'll handle industry customization yourself</li></ul><h2>The Bottom Line</h2><p>Podium is a good product. But good for everyone usually means perfect for no one. HVAC is a seasonal, relationship-driven, high-ticket business. Your follow-up tools should reflect that. Estimate sequences, membership renewals, financing nudges, seasonal check-ins — these aren't nice-to-haves. They're where the money is.</p><p>AutoGrowth AI was built around those exact moments. Podium wasn't.</p><h2>See How AutoGrowth AI Works For Your Business — Free Audit</h2><p>We'll look at your current setup and show you exactly where you're leaving money on the table. No pitch deck. No fluff. Just a straight look at your business and what's possible.</p><p><a href="/audit"><strong>Get Your Free Audit →</strong></a></p>`,
