    blufBlock: `**Smith.ai is a solid answering service — but if you're paying for a receptionist and still losing jobs to missed follow-ups, you're only solving half the problem.** **AutoGrowth AI answers calls AND chases leads, sends estimate follow-ups, collects reviews, and reactivates old customers — all without hiring anyone.**`,
    bodyContent: `<h2>What We're Actually Comparing Here</h2><p>Smith.ai is a well-known answering service. They've been around, they've got real humans on the phones, and they do that job well. I'm not going to pretend otherwise.</p><p>But answering a call is step one. What happens after that call? That's where most HVAC and home service businesses leak money every single week. And that's where this comparison gets interesting.</p><h2>Feature Comparison</h2><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;'><thead><tr style='background:#f2f2f2;'><th style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;text-align:left;'>Feature</th><th style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;text-align:left;'>AutoGrowth AI</th><th style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;text-align:left;'>Smith.ai</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>24/7 Call Answering</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Live Human Receptionists</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>❌ AI-driven</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes (hybrid)</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Bilingual Support</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Appointment Booking</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Lead Qualification</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Emergency Routing</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Missed Call Recovery</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>❌ No</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Estimate Follow-Up</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>❌ No</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Review Generation</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>❌ No</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Customer Reactivation</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>❌ No</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>Membership Renewal Reminders</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>❌ No</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>CRM / Field Software Integration</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes</td><td style='padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;'>✅ Yes (HCP, ServiceTitan)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Look, the top half of that table is a tie. Both tools answer phones. Both qualify leads. Both book appointments. Smith.ai actually has a leg up if you want a real human voice on every call — that matters to some customers.</p><p>But the bottom half? That's where the gap opens up. AutoGrowth AI keeps working after the call ends.</p><h2>Pricing — Actual Numbers</h2><p>Here's where it gets real.</p><ul><li><strong>Smith.ai AI-only plan:</strong> ~$95–$97/month</li><li><strong>Smith.ai virtual receptionist (human):</strong> Starts around $292/month</li><li><strong>Smith.ai hybrid plans:</strong> Can run up to $1,170/month depending on call volume</li><li><strong>AutoGrowth AI:</strong> Flat monthly pricing — covers answering, follow-up, reviews, reactivation, and more</li></ul><p>I'll be honest — Smith.ai's AI-only tier is cheap. If all you need is basic call coverage, $97 a month isn't bad. But the moment you want real humans involved, you're at $292 minimum. And if your call volume picks up? That number climbs fast. Some contractors I've talked to were paying over $800 a month just for answering.</p><p>AutoGrowth AI bundles everything. One price. No per-minute surprises.</p><h2>Pros and Cons</h2><h3>Smith.ai</h3><ul><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Real human receptionists — some customers genuinely prefer this</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Solid integrations with Housecall Pro and ServiceTitan</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> True 24/7 live answering with bilingual support</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> AI entry tier is affordable if you're just starting out</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Pricing scales fast with call volume — can get expensive quick</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> Stops at the call. No follow-up, no review asks, no reactivation</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> You're paying for an answering service, not a growth tool</li></ul><h3>AutoGrowth AI</h3><ul><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Goes beyond answering — works the lead after the call</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Missed call recovery keeps you from losing jobs you didn't even know you missed</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Estimate follow-up alone can recover thousands per month for most shops</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Review generation and customer reactivation baked in</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> Flat pricing — no surprises based on call volume</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> No live human receptionists — it's AI-driven</li><li><strong>Con:</strong> If you need a warm human voice on every single call, this isn't that</li></ul><h2>Best For</h2><h3>Choose Smith.ai if:</h3><p>You run a business where customers specifically expect to talk to a human and won't tolerate anything else. Or you're a low-volume shop that just needs a basic call catch with a real person. Their $97 AI plan is fine if that's your only gap.</p><h3>Choose AutoGrowth AI if:</h3><p>You're losing jobs to missed calls, unsent follow-ups, or estimates that go cold. You want one system that handles inbound calls AND works to convert and retain customers automatically. Here's the thing — most contractors I know aren't just losing calls. They're losing the revenue that should have come after the call. That's the problem AutoGrowth AI is actually built to fix.</p><h2>Bottom Line</h2><p>Smith.ai answers your phone. That's valuable. But a call that doesn't convert, a review you never asked for, an estimate that went cold, a customer you haven't talked to in two years — that's money sitting on the table. AutoGrowth AI is built to go pick it up.</p><p>If you want to see exactly where your business is leaking revenue right now, start with the free audit below.</p><p><a href='/audit' style='display:inline-block;background:#e85d04;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;'>See How AutoGrowth AI Works For Your Business — Free Audit</a></p>`,
